<title>USA: Aura unit, Computone unveil new modem.</title>
<headline>Aura unit, Computone unveil new modem.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aura Systems Inc said Friday its unit, called NewCom, and Computone Corp have developed an ISDN modem that can transmit data at 921.6 kilobytes per second.</p>
<p>The companies plan to introduce th modem at the Fall Comdex trade show in Las Vegas during November.</p>
<p>In addition, NewCom and Computone said they have entered into a marketing agreement under which NewCom will sell all of Computone's products under the NewCom name and Computone will market some NewCom modem products under the Computone name.</p>
</text>
